      <li><strong>Quick form:</strong> <a href="/ask/" class="inline-link">/ask/</a> with topic set to "Accessibility issue or feedback". Same inbox.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>If I can't resolve the issue, you can also escalate to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>The US Department of Justice's ADA Information Line: <strong>1-800-514-0301</strong> (voice) or <strong>1-833-610-1264</strong> (TTY).</li>
      <li>Your state's protection and advocacy organization.</li>
    </ul>

